{"page":220,"verses":[{"verse_key":"10:98","surah":10,"ayah":98,"ar_uthmani":"فَلَوْلَا كَانَتْ قَرْيَةٌ ءَامَنَتْ فَنَفَعَهَآ إِيمَـٰنُهَآ إِلَّا قَوْمَ يُونُسَ لَمَّآ ءَامَنُوا۟ كَشَفْنَا عَنْهُمْ عَذَابَ ٱلْخِزْىِ فِى ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ ٱلدُّنْيَا وَمَتَّعْنَـٰهُمْ إِلَىٰ حِينٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"If only a single town had believed and benefited from its belief! Only Jonah’s people did so, and when they believed, We relieved them of the punishment of disgrace in the life of this world, and let them enjoy life for a time.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَلَوْلَا","en_gloss":"So why not","transliteration":"falawlā","verse_key":"10:98"},{"pos":2,"ar":"كَانَتْ","en_gloss":"was","transliteration":"kānat","verse_key":"10:98"},{"pos":3,"ar":"قَرْيَةٌ","en_gloss":"any town","transliteration":"qaryatun","verse_key":"10:98"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ءَامَنَتْ","en_gloss":"that believed","transliteration":"āmanat","verse_key":"10:98"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فَنَفَعَهَآ","en_gloss":"and benefited it","transliteration":"fanafaʿahā","verse_key":"10:98"},{"pos":6,"ar":"إِيمَـٰنُهَآ","en_gloss":"its faith","transliteration":"īmānuhā","verse_key":"10:98"},{"pos":7,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"10:98"},{"pos":8,"ar":"قَوْمَ","en_gloss":"the people","transliteration":"qawma","verse_key":"10:98"},{"pos":9,"ar":"يُونُسَ","en_gloss":"(of) Yunus","transliteration":"yūnusa","verse_key":"10:98"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لَمَّآ","en_gloss":"When","transliteration":"lammā","verse_key":"10:98"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"they believed","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"10:98"},{"pos":12,"ar":"كَشَفْنَا","en_gloss":"We removed","transliteration":"kashafnā","verse_key":"10:98"},{"pos":13,"ar":"عَنْهُمْ","en_gloss":"from them","transliteration":"ʿanhum","verse_key":"10:98"},{"pos":14,"ar":"عَذَابَ","en_gloss":"(the) punishment","transliteration":"ʿadhāba","verse_key":"10:98"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱلْخِزْىِ","en_gloss":"(of) the disgrace","transliteration":"l-khiz'yi","verse_key":"10:98"},{"pos":16,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"10:98"},{"pos":17,"ar":"ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ","en_gloss":"the life","transliteration":"l-ḥayati","verse_key":"10:98"},{"pos":18,"ar":"ٱلدُّنْيَا","en_gloss":"of the world","transliteration":"l-dun'yā","verse_key":"10:98"},{"pos":19,"ar":"وَمَتَّعْنَـٰهُمْ","en_gloss":"and We granted them enjoyment","transliteration":"wamattaʿnāhum","verse_key":"10:98"},{"pos":20,"ar":"إِلَىٰ","en_gloss":"for","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"10:98"},{"pos":21,"ar":"حِينٍۢ","en_gloss":"a time","transliteration":"ḥīnin","verse_key":"10:98"},{"pos":22,"ar":"٩٨","en_gloss":"(98)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"10:98"}]},{"verse_key":"10:99","surah":10,"ayah":99,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَوْ شَآءَ رَبُّكَ لَـَٔامَنَ مَن فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ كُلُّهُمْ جَمِيعًا ۚ أَفَأَنتَ تُكْرِهُ ٱلنَّاسَ حَتَّىٰ يَكُونُوا۟ مُؤْمِنِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Had your Lord willed, all the people on earth would have believed. So can you [Prophet] compel people to believe?","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَوْ","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"walaw","verse_key":"10:99"},{"pos":2,"ar":"شَآءَ","en_gloss":"(had) willed","transliteration":"shāa","verse_key":"10:99"},{"pos":3,"ar":"رَبُّكَ","en_gloss":"your Lord","transliteration":"rabbuka","verse_key":"10:99"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لَـَٔامَنَ","en_gloss":"surely, (would) have believed","transliteration":"laāmana","verse_key":"10:99"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مَن","en_gloss":"who","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"10:99"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"(are) in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"10:99"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","en_gloss":"the earth","transliteration":"l-arḍi","verse_key":"10:99"},{"pos":8,"ar":"كُلُّهُمْ","en_gloss":"all of them","transliteration":"kulluhum","verse_key":"10:99"},{"pos":9,"ar":"جَمِيعًا ۚ","en_gloss":"together","transliteration":"jamīʿan","verse_key":"10:99"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أَفَأَنتَ","en_gloss":"Then, will you","transliteration":"afa-anta","verse_